{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡三各系說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "吳縣山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "按聖恩菴開山記作鄧尉山菴在玄墓山之南岡記作袁墓村葢舊志以袁為\n玄蔚為尉而名村以山耳後得宋進士葉和甫墓志與舊志相合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在游湖南"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "竺澤叢書小雞出胥門西行四十里過光福市市西五里土多石寡\n\n無大林木"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一名竹山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即繡裘山也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在游湖北"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在鄧尉山之南岡元至正間僧蔚萬峰自杭來止於此初蔚辭其師千岩請所往答曰汝\n名所止也至鄧尉結菴居之其徒大集遂創精藍為時名刹洪武中僧普壽普隱永樂中僧智璿先後重\n建內有碧炤軒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在西一里"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "北二里"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "並在南"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "順治十年經閣成復遷大藏供于閣上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "府城西吳之山，惟玄墓最僻，亦最奇。面湖而險，丹崖翠閣，望之如畫，相傳郁泰玄葬此，故名。一\n名萬峰山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄墓之北，俗名光福山"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即巧山下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今廢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恢復事蹟別見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "旹大明天順三年歲次己卯五月吉日題"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今廢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "石刻在橋南下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事蹟別見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "事蹟記云璿禪師以僧臘之高謝事，退隱同袍　禪師典其事。又師墖銘云，營\n築退居墖院二所俱備。又云瘞於祖墖之左，倚於本寺之右，崇禎六年癸酉，按察御史陳公乾陽置額，題\n為萬峰禪院，興復事蹟別見。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "濟石、誄震、濟涵、濟志"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "司空李萊嵩居士顏其額曰真獅堂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今廢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今廢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "碑記別見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舊本璿誤作第二代寶藏誤作第三代"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "師雖秉拈花之旨，猶以弘戒選擇人根，嘗于北禪寺註梵網，而殿中佛像放光，後說\n戒畢，率眾禮開元石佛，佛亦放光，城中士民皆得瞻覩也"}
